\section{Design Failures that Constrain the Final Method}
\label{app:history}

\begin{table}[H]
  \centering
  \small
  \begin{tabularx}{\linewidth}{@{}YYY@{}}
    \toprule
    \textbf{Observed failure} & \textbf{Scientific consequence} &
    \textbf{Retained decision} \\
    \midrule
    Sequence entropy increased length and EOS avoidance &
    token uncertainty can grow without solution breadth &
    optimize validator-bound outcomes \\
    Candidate-local normalization favored short responses &
    a nominally uniform target introduced length gradients &
    keep mode pressure as a separate advantage \\
    Detached candidate fitting optimized a sampled target &
    reweighting candidates is not policy MaxEnt &
    state the empirical outcome surrogate explicitly \\
    Group-centered surprise vanished under concentration &
    a controller cannot amplify a zero-dispersion carrier &
    center under the predictive bank distribution \\
    Novel wrong answers received diversity pressure &
    error variety is not useful breadth &
    admit only validator-positive outcomes \\
    Fixed or projected pressure saturated &
    the coefficient bound became the intervention &
    self-reference controllers with no projection \\
    Prompt-local replay left discoveries idle &
    late alternatives could not act promptly &
    schedule one verified bank per update \\
    A shared proposal/count bank leaked off-policy support &
    proposals changed the next on-policy advantage &
    separate replay support from objective counts \\
    \bottomrule
  \end{tabularx}
  \caption{Exploratory development determines the final design but is not
  pooled into its treatment effect.}
